{% extends "impl_en.j2" %}

{% block metainfo %}
<div class="head" role="metainfo" id="metainfo">
     <dl>
        <dt>Source data</dt>
        <dd>
           <a href="https://github.com/Informatievlaanderen/OSLOthema-wegenvignetregistratie/releases/tag/{{ data.metadata.branchtag }}">https://github.com/Informatievlaanderen/OSLOthema-wegenvignetregistratie/releases/tag/{{ data.metadata.branchtag }}</a>
        </dd>
        <dt>Changelog</dt>
        <dd>
           <a href="{{ data.metadata.documentroot }}/resources/CHANGELOG.md">{{ data.metadata.documentroot }}/resources/CHANGELOG.md</a>
        </dd>
        <dt>Comments and feedback</dt>
        <dd>
           <a href="{{ data.metadata.feedbackurl }}">{{ data.metadata.feedbackurl }}</a>
        </dd>
        <dd>
           <a href="{{ data.metadata.standaardregisterurl }}">{{ data.metadata.defaultregisterurl }}</a>
        </dd>{% if data.metadata.dependencies %}           <dt>Dependencies</dt>
           <dd>{% for dep in metadata.dependencies %}
                 <a href="{{ dep.packageurl }}">{{ dep.packagelabel }}</a>
              {%endfor %}           </dd>{%endif %}     </dl>
</div>
{% endblock %}

{% block summary %}
<p>The MAGDA Road Vignette Registrations Implementation Model is based on the <a href="" target="_blank">MAGDA Vehicle Registration Implementation Model</a> that
in turn relies on <a href="https://www.eucaris.net/" target="_blank">Eucaris</a>,
the European standard for exchanging vehicle registrations between Member States.</p>
<p>The deployment model reuses several elements of <a href="https://schema.org/Vehicle" target="_blank">Schema.org</a>
where all relevant attributes about vehicles are included that also apply to a registration of a vehicle.</p>
{% endblock %}

{% block swagger %}
<p>A set of reusable Swagger OpenAPI components for this deployment model can be found at:
<a href="{{ data.metadata.documentroot }}/resources/swagger/components.yaml" target="_blank">{{ data.metadata.documentroot }}/resources/swagger/components.yaml</a>
</p>
<p>These components are used in the MAGDA OpenAPI description of the road vignette registrations REST service, which can be found here:
<a href="{{ data.metadata.documentroot }}/resources/swagger/MAGDA-REST-wegenvignetregistraties-Swagger.yaml" target="_blank">{{ data.metadata.documentroot }}/resources/swagger/MAGDA-REST-wegenvignetregistraties-Swagger.yaml</a>
</p>
{% endblock %}
